Maintainer: Pablo Fuenzalida <pablofuenzalida427@gmail.com>
Description: G'day mate! This is a tidyverse-oriented R client for publicly accessible Sharkipedia
    life-history trait and population trend data. Provides polite HTML
    retrieval, modular parsing, and reproducible ecological workflows.
